NEW_SECTION
    .urlbar-meta{margin-left:auto; color:var(--dim); font-size:.78rem; white-space:nowrap}
    .urlbar-meta b{color:var(--cyan)}

    /* release section: controls beside a live view of what the engine has cached */
    .release-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.15fr); gap:18px; align-items:start}
    .release-grid .panel + .panel{margin-top:18px}
    .steps{margin:0; padding-left:20px; color:var(--muted); font-size:.9rem}
    .steps li{margin-bottom:6px}
    .steps b{color:var(--fg); font-weight:600}
    .ver{font-family:var(--mono); color:var(--amber)}
    #cacheTable{width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-family:var(--mono); font-size:.8rem}
    #cacheTable th{text-align:left; color:var(--dim); font-weight:500; font-size:.7rem; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; padding:0 8px 8px 0}
    #cacheTable td{border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:8px 8px 8px 0; vertical-align:top; color:var(--fg); overflow-wrap:anywhere}
    #cacheTable td:nth-child(2){color:var(--amber); white-space:nowrap}
    #cacheTable td:nth-child(3){color:var(--muted)}
    #cacheTable tr.flash td{animation:flash .9s ease-out}
    @keyframes flash{from{background:rgba(255,107,127,.18)} to{background:transparent}}
    @media (max-width:820px){ .release-grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)} }

    .diag{border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:40px 0 64px}
    .diag .log{height:220px}
    @media (max-width:720px){ .topbar .wrap{height:auto; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; flex-wrap:wrap} nav{margin-left:0} }

REASON
Added section 02 'Shipping a new release' (steps, release controls, live sessionStorage table, app snippet) with its page-specific styles, renumbered validation to 03 and added a cacheVersion = "" validation button. Every module example must demonstrate its config and failure modes; cacheVersion and clearCache() are new API.

